"Logs are output to stdout. On Linux `ANSI escape color code <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ANSI_escape_code>`_ (eg ^[[39m)  is used and could be "
"disabled by setting no_ansiesc environment variable to any value like ``env "
"no_ansiesc=1``"
msgstr ""

